
# Google Data Analytics Professional Certificate – Capstone Project

This repository contains the data analysis artifacts, code, and visualizations completed as part of the **Google Data Analytics Professional Certificate** issued via Coursera.

## 🎓 Program Overview
The program consists of 9 intensive courses covering the complete data analysis lifecycle:
* **Ask & Meet Stakeholder Needs:** Defining business problems and structuring objectives.
* **Prepare & Clean Data:** Managing data integrity, formatting, and handling missing data.
* **Process & Analyze:** Executing structured database queries and processing data using spreadsheets and Python.
* **Share & Act:** Designing interactive dashboards to communicate actionable, data-driven insights.

## 🛠️ Core Skills & Tools Covered
* **Languages:** SQL, Python
* **Data Visualization:** Tableau, Spreadsheets
* **Methodologies:** Data Cleansing, Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA), Statistical Analysis

